+```
+08:00
+08:00-08:41 (41m, 1 changes)
+```
+
+The first answer is a moment, not a journey: the last one at which setting off
+still works. The second is what the ordinary search offers from that moment,
+less anything that would turn up late. `session.reaching("flughafen", day, by)`
+gives the same answer for every stop at once, which is the backward twin of
+`session.reachable`:
