+```
+
+```
+ostfeld 08:26
+marktplatz 08:10
+westtor 08:00
+```
+
+Read that as a promise about each stop on its own: stand at Marktplatz at any
+time up to 08:10 and Flughafen by nine is still possible. The destination is
+not in the answer, the way the origin is not in `reachable`.
